sequenceDiagram
    actor C as Client
    actor F as Freelancer
    participant API as Backend
    participant DB as MongoDB
    C->>API: Post job (no wallet check)
    F->>API: Submit proposal
    C->>API: Accept proposal
    API->>DB: Wallet covers milestone 1?
    API->>DB: Create contract, fund milestone 1
    API-->>F: Hired, escrow funded
    F->>API: Submit delivery
    API->>DB: Milestone submitted, 7-day window
    alt Client approves
        C->>API: Approve
    else Seven days pass
        API->>API: Scheduler auto-releases
    end
    API->>DB: Release, fee deducted, wallet credited
    alt More milestones
        C->>API: Fund the next milestone
    else Last milestone
        API->>DB: Contract and job completed
    end
    C->>API: Review
    F->>API: Review
